{
  "slug": "cf-crawl",
  "name": "Cf Crawl",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Crawl any website via Cloudflare Browser Rendering API. Free Firecrawl alternative — returns clean markdown, HTML, or JSON. No rate limits, no API keys to buy.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `cf-crawl` (This skill should be used when the user asks to crawl a website, scrape pages, get site content,…) and **1 command**, `crawl` (Crawl a website and return clean markdown content).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cf-crawl@claude-community` from `mslugga35/claude-plugin-cf-crawl`.",
